 "Strict, Hybrid and Dense Smile, the Three Forms of the 2025 Documents",
 :description
 "The three forms of the Smile Prompt Language in the documents of July 2025, Strict Smile for programmers, Hybrid Smile for writing prompts by hand, and Dense Smile compressed toward the fewest tokens, with the token counts behind Smile's name, and how my words described them, with every source.",
